  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n&\\text {  Given, } \\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0^{+}} \\frac{x}{p}\\left[\\frac{q}{x}\\right]\\\\\r\n&\\begin{array}{l}\r\n=\\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0^{+}} \\frac{x}{p}\\left(\\frac{q}{x}-\\{\\frac{q}{x}\\right\\}\\right) \\\\\r\n=\\frac{[q]}{p}-\\frac{x}{p}\\left\\{\\frac{q}{x}\\right\\} \\\\\r\n=\\frac{[q]}{p}-0=\\frac{[q]}{p}\r\n\\end{array}\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$",
